---
/**
 * Systems.astro — Phase 5.1
 *
 * Iteration note: Phase 5 gave each of the six capability chapters a
 * genuinely different grid (dark feature, quiet feature, 2-col diagram,
 * diptych, 3-up poster, calm cream-warm feature). Reviewed on the live
 * site, that read exactly as the brief described: "los proyectos parecen
 * pertenecer a sistemas de diseño diferentes." Variety between chapters
 * was the wrong lever — uniformity is.
 *
 * What changed: every chapter now shares one identical composition — a
 * single column, one type scale (large for the anchor, compact for
 * support entries), one spacing rhythm. The only structural exception is
 * Sonoro's dark-inset "featured" treatment, which isn't a layout choice —
 * doc 16 Part 2 gives it that emphasis specifically because it's the
 * single deepest piece of evidence and opens the whole section; every
 * other chapter, anchor or support, uses the exact same neutral row.
 * The six capabilities (doc 16 Part 1) are unchanged — nothing was
 * reclassified, only the container got simpler.
 */

